    '</section><section><h2 class="section-title">마무리·결과</h2><p>오늘 준비한 내용,<br>도움이 되셨으면 좋겠어요!<br><br><span class="hl-trt">임플란트 치료</span> 후에도 꾸준한 관리가 정말<br>중요하다는 거,<br>잊지 마세요! 😊</p><img src="https://v5.airtableusercontent.com/v3/u/44/44/1757073600000/8F3qp9VNIT7pAEdox32fdQ/-UPvAdScGixsXjplQ9jyHOKZZBQKP1-KZ2dpOgS5npybb1dgM9e2Lm0hRQM6e_uIudwLwe7To7gE8pwEA4J4ZpPytM0PIdupkAaHty2pf2_HcdOomJZv3dqtV7KtoSTUXyNsrfTTISaGGKEanHf-Zg/LxynB7EAVwuyJcUYOuaCGwkE_B70KWygZu7Q9jM65xI" alt="마무리 이모티콘" style="width:100px; height:100px; object-fit:contain; vertical-align:middle;">\n' +
